        "text_3WJ4hY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Known as Rosses Point, County Sligo Golf Club is a world-class links set on Ireland’s northwest coast. Designed by Harry Colt in 1927, the course combines dramatic views of Benbulben and the Atlantic with over a century of championship play.</p><p>Home to the West of Ireland Championship since 1923, it’s a favorite of legends like Rory McIlroy and Padraig Harrington—and a true gem of Irish golf.</p>"
          }
        }
